<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ckb" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>ApexKurd</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif; background-color: #121212; color: white; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        header { background: #1f1f1f; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #d21034; }
        h1 { margin: 0; color: #ffce00; }
        .hero { background: url('https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Peshmerga_fighters.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover; height: 300px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .container { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; padding: 20px; }
        .card { background: #1f1f1f; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; transition: 0.3s; border: 1px solid #333; }
        .card:hover { transform: scale(1.05); border-color: #ffce00; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #777; font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 50px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>ApexKurd</h1>
</header>

<div class="hero"></div>

<div class="container">
    <div class="card"><h3>یاری مۆبایل</h3></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>ئەپی مۆبایل</h3></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>یاری کۆمپیوتەر</h3></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>بەرنامەی کۆمپیوتەر</h3></div>
</div>

<div class="footer">
    <p>دیزاین کراوە لەلایەن: ئەلان گۆڵسەر</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
